ba(19, 35, 31, 0.10); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><div style="position: relative; width: 60px; height: 60px; flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px;"><circle cx="30.0" cy="30.0" r="27.0" fill="none" stroke="rgba(19, 35, 31, 0.22)" stroke-width="6"></circle><circle cx="30.0" cy="30.0" r="27.0" fill="none" stroke="rgb(19, 35, 31)" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="101.79 169.65" transform="rotate(-90 30.0 30.0)"></circle></svg><div style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 18px; font-weight: 700;">٦٠٪</span></div></div></div><div style="width: 76px; height: 76px; border-radius: 38px; background: rgba(19, 35, 31, 0.10); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><span style="font-family: Amiri, serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 700;">العصر</span><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; font-weight: 600;">٣:٤٧</span></div></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 372px; left: 31px; right: 31px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; color: rgb(91, 106, 100);"><span>مستطيل</span><span>دائري · التقدّم</span><span>دائري · الصلاة</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 80px; left: 0px; right: 0px;"></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 410px; left: 31px; right: 31px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(91, 106, 100);">الأسطر على شاشة القفل: ودجت «ضمن السطر» تحت التاريخ، والمستطيل والدائريان تحت الساعة. لا يظهر موضع القراءة ولا عدّاد المسبحة على شاشة القفل.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div 